WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.620
Now this, I thought was genius.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.120
Look.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.179
No broken nails opening it, and it even
closes the can if there's some left.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.760
Nilce, come on, I'm not, I'm not gonna
knock it, I'm just gonna put some sense

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.160
into your head, that's different.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.480
The can was made that way precisely
so you don't need a tool to open it.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:23.360
We can print our friends' names
on each of these little things,

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.779
so everyone gets their own name.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.480
Get it? Instead of 'enjoy', you
can put your friends' names.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.640
And since we don't have many
friends, half a dozen will do.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.560
Or you could just grab a permanent marker.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.640
Nobody's gonna do that.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.880
Honey! If I had a friend and I
went to his place, and he gave me

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.760
one of these things with
my name to put on my can,

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.200
I'd be really worried.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.820
If he wasn't retired with nothing
else to do, I'd be really worried.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.160
Once you buy a 3D printer, you
have to find stuff to do with it.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.459
That's a great use for it.
Now it all makes sense.
